          "end": 10.04,
          "en": "component and template-related feature offered by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "And you can really become creative with them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "For example, we don't have to provide",
