          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "We could change onSubmit and expect to get the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 31.59,
          "en": "which should be of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.59,
          "end": 35.253,
          "en": "and the ticketText, which should be of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.868,
          "end": 40.65,
